A group of Casterwill Hunters accompanied [[Kiel]] to [[Medusa's Island]] to meet [[Stack]] who promised to recover [[Medusa]]. After Kiel was taken prisoner by the [[Huntik Foundation]] in [[Medusa's Cave]], the Hunters arrived with [[Marduk]], rescuing him and fighting [[Dante Vale]]. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}}

Two Casterwill Hunters traveled with [[Kiel]] and [[Marduk]] to [[the Cloisters]] in [[New York, USA]] in an attempt to discover the hidden hiding places of the [[Casterwill family]]. The two Hunters were defeated after a fight with the Huntik team on the roof of the Cloisters. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}} More of Kiel's Casterwill Hunters traveled to [[Mexico]] where they fought against [[Dante Vale]] outside the [[Pyramid of the Sun]] in an attempt to stop the activation of the [[Blue Star]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}} 

Hundreds of Casterwill Hunters traveled to the [[Great Rift Valley, Africa]] as part of the huge [[Blood Spiral]] army. {{source|Sophie on Trial}} They later fought against the [[Casterwill family]] in the attack on the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. One group, led by [[Marduk]], reached the top of the cliff face but were defeated by [[Nimue Casterwill]] who sacrificed herself. {{source|The Spiral War}}

A group of Casterwill Hunters ambushed the Huntik team on [[Phoenix]]' island, trapping [[Lok]] and [[Sophie]] in a lava tube. {{source|The Dead Magic Island}} More Casterwill Hunters were ambushed by the Huntik team before they descended into the volcano to find Phoenix. The Hunters were held off by [[Montehue]] and [[Tersly]]. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}

On the longest night of the year, Marduk and his Hunters attempted to stop the team reaching [[Nostradamus]]' grave. After destroying their plane using [[Psikofen]], the Hunters followed the team to the graveyard where they fought again. The Huntik team escaped using [[Umbra]]. {{source|Words from Eathon}} During the final battle, the Hunters fought the [[Huntik Foundation]] and [[Casterwill family]]. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}} The Hunters fought until the defeat of [[the Betrayer]]. {{source|Dante's Return}}

